      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Retrieve all items from the previous node\nconst items = $input.all();\n\n// Initialize the context string\nlet contextString = \"### BATCH EMAIL CONTEXT ###\\n\\n\";\n\n// Loop through each email and extract the critical data\nitems.forEach((item, index) => {\n    const data = item.json;\n    \n    // Parse the UNIX timestamp into a readable ISO string (UTC)\n    // This is mandatory. Do not expect the LLM to do this math.\n    const timestampMs = parseInt(data.internalDate);\n    const readableDate = new Date(timestampMs).toISOString(); \n\n    // Build the clean string\n    contextString += `--- Email ${index + 1} ---\\n`;\n    contextString += `ID: ${data.id}\\n`;\n    contextString += `From: ${data.From}\\n`;\n    contextString += `Received Time (UTC): ${readableDate}\\n`;\n    contextString += `Snippet: ${data.snippet}\\n\\n`;\n});\n\n// Output a single item containing the compiled string to pass to your LLM node\nreturn [\n    {\n        json: {\n            extracted_context: contextString\n        }\n    }\n];"
